  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can delay the application of your hack magic ability until you are ready to exploit it. You can reveal a plan to be a use of hack magic to alter a magic item or effect you could access when you last prepared plans. Revealing this plan is a full-round action, which can include drawing and activating the item you reveal to be hacked if the activation is normally a standard action or less, or else concentrating on or otherwise directing a magic effect you reveal to be hacked.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
